# NOTE on generated code: the stubs under src/main/java and the generated pom.xml are
# deliberately COMMITTED - same convention as the other ONDEWO client SDKs - so the library can
# be consumed, opened in an IDE and built by JitPack without Docker. Only BUILD OUTPUT and
# machine-local caches are ignored here.

